The canonical contract is [`docs/delivery-contract.md`](../../docs/delivery-contract.md).
ADR 0040 is Zach's narrow, expiring authorization to bootstrap this plugin with Cursor outside
Paperclip. It is not permission to touch an existing Paperclip-owned issue, run, workspace,
branch, PR, company configuration, or production install.

The parent must run `gpt-5.6-sol-high`. It delegates code writing to the project-scoped
Composer/Grok agents by task class, keeps a single writer in a shared checkout, and retains
architecture, integration, git publication, exact-head acceptance, merge, and release
ownership. Do not use `auto`, Fast variants, API keys, `--force`, or `--yolo`.

The product is an additive read-only plugin. Never patch/fork Paperclip core or request a
lifecycle-write capability. Missing authoritative facts remain visibly unavailable.

Manifest capabilities do not sandbox same-origin plugin UI. UI data access is only through
`usePluginData`; navigation uses only `useHostNavigation`. Forbid direct browser
HTTP/action paths and prove that boundary with static, built-bundle, and browser-network
checks.
